      <h2>What you agree to</h2>
      <p>When you submit the "Request a call back" form, you agree that Data Leasers, LLC may:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>store the details you enter so we can respond to your enquiry;</li>
        <li>email you about arranging and following up on that call.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You will not receive marketing emails from the form unless you tick a separate box to opt in. Nothing you send us is shared with a data buyer or an AI company without your written approval.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:info@dataleasers.com">info@dataleasers.com</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Stop contact</strong> by replying "stop" to any email from us, or by asking us directly.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete your details</strong> by emailing us. We will confirm once they have been removed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Withdrawing consent does not affect anything we did before you withdrew it. It may mean we cannot continue an enquiry.</p>

      <h2>Your data, your decision</h2>
      <p>Before any dataset is shared or licensed, we agree the terms with you in writing. Consent for that is separate from this form and is always requested on its own.</p>

      <p>See also our <a href="privacy.html">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
